[h1]Wish[/h1]
[i]Be careful what you wish for.[/i]

[b]Wish for your heart's desire—but every wish comes at a cost.[/b]

Choose an eligible item and guarantee that it appears in a normal shop slot on the next reroll. Queue multiple Wishes, while item tiers and bans are still respected. Wished items retain their normal price and ordinary shop behaviour.

[h2]Make a Wish[/h2]
[list]
[*]Search the eligible item pool and choose an item.
[*]Guarantee that item in a normal shop slot on the next reroll.
[*]Queue multiple Wishes before rerolling.
[*]Keep normal item prices and ordinary buy, lock, and reroll behaviour.
[*]Respect item tiers and anything you have banned.
[/list]

[h2]Tempt fate with a Crooked Wish[/h2]
[list]
[*]Spend one of Monkey's Paw's three fingers to choose an item.
[*]Guarantee it on the next reroll.
[*]Reveal and queue a one-wave Calamity as the price of your wish.
[/list]

[h2]Characters and items[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Djinn[/b] makes Wishes, but each one demands a price.
[*][b]Magic Lamp[/b] is a repeatable Legendary item that grants another Wish. Win as Djinn to unlock it for other characters.
[*][b]Shaman[/b] makes Crooked Wishes with a catch—every wish brings a one-wave Calamity.
[*][b]Monkey's Paw[/b] is a unique Legendary item with three extended fingers. Each Crooked Wish curls one. Win as Shaman to unlock it for other characters.
[*][b]Wish for Friends[/b] is a consumable Rare item that turns the next wave into a Horde. A cursed invitation grants +10% XP Gain for that wave. More friends mean more danger—and more potential rewards.
[*][b]Wish It Away[/b] grants a Ban token, but the next wave's enemies gain +10% Health. Cursed grants two Bans.
[*][b]Wish You Were Here[/b] invites an additional Elite to the next wave with a guaranteed crate. Cursed guarantees a second crate.
[*][b]Wish for Growth[/b] adds +0.3 percentage points to Harvesting growth each wave while held. Cursed adds +0.6 percentage points.
[*][b]Wish for Harvest[/b] is a Legendary item that permanently grants +80 Harvesting, but enemies gain +15% Health next wave. Cursed permanently grants +120 Harvesting.
[*][b]Wish for Corruption[/b] curses one random uncursed item or weapon in your inventory when bought. A cursed copy curses two eligible pieces of gear, if available.
[*][b]Wish for Knowledge[/b] permanently grants +30% XP Gain, but the total number of enemies permanently increases by 2%. Cursed grants +40% XP Gain for the same price.
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
This release targets Brotato 1.2.0.1 and ModLoader 6.3.0.
Abyssal Terrors is required unless otherwise noted in the change notes.

Start a new run after enabling, disabling, or updating mods.

[h2]Artwork disclaimer and call for artists[/h2]
All custom artwork in Wish was AI-generated. I'm a software engineer and a terrible, terrible artist, so AI helped get the mod to a shippable place—but human cleanup, redraws, and replacement artwork would be hugely appreciated.

If you would like to improve any of the art, please visit the [url=https://github.com/matthewrdev/brotato-mods]public repository[/url] and open an issue or pull request. Contributions from actual artists would mean a lot.

[url=https://github.com/matthewrdev/brotato-mods]Source code and issue tracker[/url]
